[25.865234, "o", "Setup: first-draft   identity provider: http://127.0.0.1:34789\r\n\r\n   helpdesk-app       bob signed in (code + PKCE): {aud=['orchestrator-agent', 'tickets-agent', 'mail-agent', 'metrics-agent', 'tickets-api', 'mail-api'], scope=[tickets:read tickets:write tickets:delete mail:send], lives 3600s}\r\n   helpdesk-app       bob asks: 'Show me T-4711'\r\n   orchestrator-agent plan for bob: read T-4711\r\n   orchestrator-agent -> tickets-agent: forwards the token it was given (passthrough)\r\n   tickets-agent      -> tickets-api: uses ITS OWN service account, says it acts for bob\r\n   tickets-api        GET T-4711 for bob via tickets-agent: ok\r\n\r\nAnswer (200): T-4711 'Laptop will not join the VPN': Since Monday the VPN client says 'certificate expired'. Tried a reboot.\r\n\r\nWhat the APIs logged:\r\n   tickets-api GET    T-4711               ok       user=bob  via azp=tickets-agent (no act claim)  \r\n"]
